Revision history for Perl extension Package-Prototype

0.02 2026-09-14T09:13:38Z

    - Add create() with explicit property readers, writers, and CODE data values.
    - Verify positional signatures and Perl 5.44 named parameters.
    - Fix Unicode method names and class labels on Perl 5.36 and later.
    - Preserve native boolean values through getters and property writers.
    - Fix getter lifetimes, replacement caches, and leaks on normal and exception paths.
    - Test Perl 5.12 and 5.36 through 5.44. Perl 5.8 remains unverified.
    - Declare the XS build helper as a configure dependency.

